    {
      "textRaw": "MediainfoNativeObject",
      "name": "mediainfonativeobject",
      "desc": "<p>MediainfoNativeObject 是 <code>mediainfo(path)</code> / <code>mediainfo.read(path)</code> 返回的媒体信息对象.</p>\n<p>源码依据:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>app/src/main/java/org/autojs/autojs/runtime/api/augment/mediainfo/Mediainfo.kt</code></li>\n<li><code>app/src/main/java/org/autojs/autojs/runtime/api/augment/mediainfo/MediainfoNativeObject.kt</code></li>\n<li><code>app/src/main/java/org/mediainfo/android/MediaInfo.kt</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>常见相关方法或属性:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"mediainfo#m-read\">mediainfo.read</a>(path)</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">MediainfoNativeObject</p>\n\n<hr>\n<p><code>MediainfoNativeObject</code> 构造时会读取一次 MediaInfo 输出文本, 并把文本解析为可访问的对象属性. 当前对象没有显式 <code>close()</code> 方法; 底层读取由 <code>scriptRuntime.mediaInfo</code> 完成.</p>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] path",
          "name": "[p]_path",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>运行时解析后的媒体文件路径.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] path"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] inform",
          "name": "[p]_inform",
          "desc": "<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>MediaInfo 输出的原始文本. 动态属性解析也来自这段文本.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p] inform"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] general",
          "name": "[m]_general",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "general(parameter?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "general",
              "signatures": [
